; states_tour: every state in turn, no effects, so each change is heard plainly. 90 s.
song tools/music/adaptive/battle.asong
length 90s
at 0s state calm        ; the fight opens; the player reads the enemy and thinks
at 14s state fight      ; dice thrown: the drums come in
at 28s state low        ; the enemy is low: the counter and the hats join
at 42s state danger     ; the cat is low: half time, a heartbeat, only the twitch
at 56s state windup     ; an elite winds up its big move: the King's motif, the lead goes out
at 70s state victory    ; one more hit wins: the motif turns major and climbs
at 86s fade
